 "description": "List active previews of a Git deployment, their branch, .onion address and expiry. Onion preview addresses need neither public DNS nor public TLS certificates; a protected HTTPS preview uses a random label rather than the branch name. Use this after pushing a branch to find its URL or see what is still running.",
